	(text "Changes from the 2023 drawing:\n - J4 pin 8 (Pico pin 28, GND) tied to GND; the 2023 drawing left every Pico GND pin unconnected.\n - Output stage A (U3A -> J13, envelope 1) fed from DAC VA (U4 pin 8), the channel the firmware drives.\n - Added output stage B (U3B -> J14, envelope 2) from DAC VB (U4 pin 6), a copy of stage A (R12-R16, C5, C6).\n - Removed a dead-end wire below J3.\nUnchanged: C2 sits from the inverting input to GND in parallel with R7; C5 mirrors it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
